Package: ai-cctv-edge
Version: 0.3.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Eye-O-T contributors
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-gi, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-libcamera, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-libav
Description: AI_CCTV Raspberry Pi camera edge service
 Captures H.264 camera video, exposes or publishes RTSP, keeps a bounded
 local MPEG-TS backup and provides authenticated recovery transfer.
